    "updated_at": "2019-03-30T22:14:44Z",
    "body": "I think deprecation and removal here is not likely to break pages, but is likely to cause many, many analytics providers or bespoke shutdown routines on sites to work incorrectly, and thus make page operators sad. It'd be cool if you want to try, though.",
