    "created_at": "2022-01-10T22:56:43Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-01-10T22:56:43Z",
    "body": "Yup, relevant [Chromium code](https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/blink/renderer/core/loader/image_loader.cc;l=506)\r\n\r\nI'm less confident about this, but it seems like [WebKit's code](https://github.com/WebKit/WebKit/blob/main/Source/WebCore/loader/PingLoader.cpp#L83) is loading the image similarly to other PING-type requests, so it's likely to impose the same CSP restrictions.",
